			"notes": "## Added\n- While rolling the outcome in `Gambling` mode, the rolling text has now a \"pulse\" effect.\n- The background of the text that was mentioned above is now dynamically adjusting to the text's length, rather than having a fixed length\n- Button auras now have a dynamic effect - they change color upon hovering over them\n- Added cave-specific messages, and will add more in the future!\n\n## Removed\n- Removed the unneccesary logging, that could be found in the `.log` files. It was like spamming.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/wuritz/better-creeper-consent/compare/1.3.1...1.5.0"
